          </svg>
          {SITE_NAME}
        </a>
        <p>Bespoke software development for UK SMEs. Custom platforms, system integration, and AI automation. Software you own, not rent. Based in the United Kingdom.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--grey-400);">Looking for <a href="https://ajairu.ai" style="color:var(--blue);text-decoration:underline;">AI consulting and strategy</a>? Visit our sister site ajairu.ai.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Services</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/services#integration">System Integration &amp; Automation</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services#bespoke">Bespoke Software Platform</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services#erp-replacement">SaaS / ERP Replacement</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services#technical-consultancy">Technical Consultancy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services#support">Ongoing Support</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Company</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/process">How It Works</a></li>
          <li><a href="/assessment">Free Software Readiness Quiz</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guide">Free Guide</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/comparison">How We Compare</a></li>
          <li><a href="/best-software-developer-uk">Best Software Developer UK</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Get in Touch</h4>
